 "source_instruction": "i would like a grey twin size bunk bed made of solid wood.",
 "query": "My neighbor\u2019s tabby cat keeps sneaking over to nap on my windowsill and I\u2019ve been leaving out little bowls of tuna for it even though my roommate is allergic to cat dander and keeps complaining about the fur all over the couch cushions. I also spent last weekend repainting the accent wall in my guest room a soft muted blue and hung up those thrifted woven macram\u00e9 wall hangings I found at the flea market a few weeks back. Oh, and I heard solid wood twin size beds hold up way better for frequent guest use than the particleboard ones, and the grey finish ones don\u2019t show scuffs as easily even if people drag their suitcases up against them, plus anything under $670 fits the little budget I set aside for that room\u2019s updates.",
